Neon Tides is released under two licences according to content type.

1. CODE — MIT License
   Applies to: executable JavaScript, HTML markup and structure, CSS,
   tools/*.mjs, asset metadata and programmatic data structures in the root
   and voyage/ directories.

2. ARTWORK AND STORY — Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)
   Applies to: artwork in assets/, inline SVG illustration in classic.html,
   Canvas and SVG artwork, dialogue, clue and rumour wording, scene
   descriptions, endings and other story text, including such content in
   JavaScript files, and the prose of documentation files.

For files containing both code and creative content, apply MIT to the code
and CC BY 4.0 to the artwork and prose. The licence texts and notices follow.

